    <item>
      <title>Wukong Wants to Play Too</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukong-joins-the-game/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Pigsy, Rabbit and Ao Bing are rolling a ball in a circle. Wukong wants to play so much that he runs in and grabs it. Sandy shows him another way: look, ask, wait. Soon there is room in the circle for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-joins-the-game-v1.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-joins-the-game-v1.jpg" alt="Wukong Wants to Play Too" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <dc:creator>Peihong Guo</dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukong-joins-the-game/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Wukong Visits the Pumpkin Patch</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukong-visits-the-pumpkin-patch/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Wukong, Ao Bing and Nezha head into a corn maze on the way to the pumpkin field. Nezha dashes ahead and they pop out back at the start, so they look for clues: left at the scarecrow, right at the pumpkins, straight ahead — and a pumpkin each to take home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-visits-the-pumpkin-patch-v1.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-visits-the-pumpkin-patch-v1.jpg" alt="Wukong Visits the Pumpkin Patch" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <dc:creator>Peihong Guo</dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukong-visits-the-pumpkin-patch/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Wukong’s Little Dinosaur Halloween</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukongs-little-dinosaur-halloween/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Wukong has a brand-new dinosaur costume and a big, loud ROAR. But when a tiny hedgehog opens the first door, Wukong finds a softer way to say trick or treat. Ring the bell, take one, say thank you — and share with a friend.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukongs-little-dinosaur-halloween-v1.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukongs-little-dinosaur-halloween-v1.jpg" alt="Wukong’s Little Dinosaur Halloween" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <dc:creator>Peihong Guo</dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukongs-little-dinosaur-halloween/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Wukong’s Starry Stage</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukongs-starry-stage/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Wukong sets up a little stage for story night. Six paper stars, then two more from Rabbit — eight altogether. The entrance needs some too, so they take away three: five are left on the curtain, but still eight altogether. And Pigsy has an idea for the moon.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukongs-starry-stage-v1.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukongs-starry-stage-v1.jpg" alt="Wukong’s Starry Stage" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <dc:creator>Peihong Guo</dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukongs-starry-stage/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Big Cards, Little Numbers</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/big-cards-little-numbers/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Nezha paints a big card with a 3 and a small card with a 5. Wukong is sure the big card wins, until Rabbit’s beads show that five is more than three. Big card or small card, the number tells how many.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/big-cards-little-numbers-v2.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/big-cards-little-numbers-v2.jpg" alt="Big Cards, Little Numbers" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <dc:creator>Peihong Guo</dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/big-cards-little-numbers/</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Princess Iron Fan’s Ribbon Parade</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/iron-fans-ribbon-parade/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Princess Iron Fan plans a ribbon parade. Wukong’s rolled-up ribbon looks shortest, then he tries a sneaky start. Lined up at the same line, the ribbons go short, longer, longest.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/iron-fans-ribbon-parade-v1.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/iron-fans-ribbon-parade-v1.jpg" alt="Princess Iron Fan’s Ribbon Parade" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
