      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/iron-fans-ribbon-parade/</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Pigsy’s Peach Puzzle</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/pigsys-peach-puzzle/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Pigsy is sure three big peaches are more than five small ones. Wukong and Rabbit line them up in pairs to compare, and Pigsy finds out: big or small, one peach is one peach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/pigsys-peach-puzzle-v1.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/pigsys-peach-puzzle-v1.jpg" alt="Pigsy’s Peach Puzzle" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
