      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/pigsys-peach-puzzle/</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Wukong and the Block Bridge</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukong-and-the-block-bridge/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The toy train needs a bridge over a blue cloth river. Wukong and Ao Bing measure with different blocks and disagree, until Pigsy brings blocks of the same size: end to end, no gaps, the river is four blocks wide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-and-the-block-bridge-v1.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-and-the-block-bridge-v1.jpg" alt="Wukong and the Block Bridge" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
