      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukong-and-the-block-bridge/</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Wukong’s Missing Picnic Cup</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukongs-missing-picnic-cup/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Wukong sets out cups for his picnic friends: one, two, three, four. But when he sits down, his own hands are empty! Counting again, everyone finds the friend he forgot: Wukong himself.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukongs-missing-picnic-cup-v1.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukongs-missing-picnic-cup-v1.jpg" alt="Wukong’s Missing Picnic Cup" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
