    <item>
      <title>Wukong Visits the Aquarium</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukong-visits-the-aquarium/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Wukong visits an aquarium with Ao Bing and Sandy. He watches kelp, a hiding fish, jellyfish, and a sea otter, then draws three favorites on his card.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-visits-the-aquarium-v2.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-visits-the-aquarium-v2.jpg" alt="Wukong Visits the Aquarium" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
