    <item>
      <title>Wukong Learns to Swim</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukong-learns-to-swim/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Wukong is curious about swimming, but the pool feels big. With Coach Otter nearby and Ao Bing cheering him on, he practices bubbles, floating, and kicks until he swims a little way on his own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-learns-to-swim-v4.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-learns-to-swim-v4.jpg" alt="Wukong Learns to Swim" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
